## 4. Enterprise Security & Compliance

Security is baked into the foundation of the Amdox ERP architecture, achieving a zero-trust environment.

> [!CAUTION]
> **Cryptographic Tamper Evidence**  
> An `AuditInterceptor` traps every `POST`, `PUT`, and `DELETE` payload and constructs a chained SHA-256 hash. If a malicious actor bypasses the API to modify the database directly (e.g., altering an invoice value), the `verifyChainIntegrity` service flags the cryptographic mismatch instantly.

* **Zero-Trust Boundaries:** Every API request passes through strict tenant middleware intercepting the `x-tenant-id` header.
* **Dynamic Row-Level Security (RLS):** Queries do not rely on manual `WHERE tenantId = ?` clauses. A custom Prisma extension dynamically scopes all database interactions at the postgres level, ensuring cross-tenant data leaks are physically impossible.

