## 5. Artificial Intelligence & Forecasting

The platform bridges deterministic ERP logic with non-deterministic Machine Learning models:
* **Prophet Integration:** The Supply Chain module gathers 90-day SKU movement history and sends it to the Python ML microservice.
* **Dynamic Forecasting:** The ML node trains a model on the fly and returns a 30-day forecast, which is rendered on the Next.js frontend using ECharts visualizations.

> [!TIP]
> This capability allows procurement managers to anticipate stock shortages weeks in advance based on historical velocity and seasonal trends.

